It's not the playing style. It's the results of the lowered AC in the early
and midgame. Later on when you have a ton of enchant armors, holy water,
dragon mail, and the like, it isn't as crucial.

But AC, weight, and hunger management are issues in the early to midgame.
Weightless AC impacts each of those three factors.

And often a careful playing style in the early game can help you get to 
midgame. Lower AC in the early game can help you get to midgame. A buff
pet in the early game can help you get to midgame. Think of soldier or
fire ants in the Oracle or Sokoban level. Being able to run away due to
not being burdened, lessened damage, and being harder to hit are all helpful
at that stage of the game.

